<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER - AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER - AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in African club</p>
<p>soccer competitions on Sunday:</p>
<p>Confederation of African Football (CAF) Cup  final, first</p>
<p>leg</p>
<p>In Sousse: Etoile S Sahel (Tunisia) 3 Kawkab Marrakesh</p>
<p>(Morocco) 1 (halftime 3-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>-Etoile S Sahel - Kais Ghodhbane (24), Lotfi Baccouche</p>
<p>(30-penalty), Riyadh Bouazizi (36)</p>
<p>Kawkab Marrakesh - Aziz Zebdi (5)</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000</p>
<p>Second leg on November 30 in Marrakesh</p>
</text>
